@startuml
title Schedule an Appointment

start

:Client: Enter portal and choose site (captures site id);
:System: Show landing page for site and an option to reserve an appointment;
:Client: Click "reserve an appointment";
:System: Show screening questions;

if (My household already has an appointment) then (no)
  if (I am a veteran, active duty person, person with a disability or senior aged 65 or older; or have household income $89k or less?) then (no)
    :System: Show message explaining screening requirements and that user is unqualified for services;
    stop
  else (yes)
    :System: Show page for selecting available dates;
    repeat
      if (Selected date) then (yes)
        :System: Show page for selecting available blocks;
        if (Selected block) then (yes)
          :System: Give confirmation for date and time;
          if (Client confirmed) then (yes)
            :System: Update database with new reservation;
            :System: Send confirmation email;
          endif
        endif
      endif
    repeat while (Confirmed date and time) is (no) not (yes)
  endif
else (yes)
  :System: Show message explaining one appointment per fiscal year per household;
endif

stop
@enduml